Package: robjc
Title: Objective-C-Inspired Object System Built on 'R6'
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
        given = "Satoshi",
        family = "Yano",
        role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
        email = "yanosatoshi@gmail.com"),
    person(
        given = "R6 authors",
        role = "cph",
        comment = "Portions derived from the R6 package")
    )
Description: Provides an object system for R built on 'R6' and inspired by
    Objective-C. Class factories support inheritance, protocols, singletons,
    and scalar wrappers with typed missing values. Mutable and immutable
    arrays, vectors, sets, dictionaries, and data frame wrappers support
    application objects; sets and dictionaries use class-defined equality and
    hashing for lookup. Keyed archiving preserves shared references and
    cycles when saving and restoring object graphs, and supports mapping
    archived classes to current classes during restoration.
